"publisher": "전북도민일보", "published_at": "2026-10-28T16:33:00+09:00", "source_url": "http://www.domin.co.kr/news/articleView.html?idxno=1573513", "matched_keywords": ["전주시의회"], "preferred": false}, {"id": "2ac5a28eef28809eafe5875646dd6f99", "title": "전주시의회 피지컬AI 혁신연구회, 현장서 제조기업 AI 전환 길 찾는다", "publisher": "아시아뉴스전북", "published_at": "2026-10-28T16:23:49+09:00", "source_url": "https://www.mjeonbuk.com/news/articleView.html?idxno=149646", "matched_keywords": ["전주시의회"], "preferred": false}, {"id": "0d5ded56b820b7328a80fc187f8449cd", "title": "전주시의회 최명권 의원 “재정자율성 회복 위한 특단의 지방세입구조 혁신 촉구”", "publisher": "전북제일신문", "published_at": "2026-10-28T16:05:33+09:00", "source_url": "https://www.jbjnews.com/news/articleView.html?idxno=329533", "matched_keywords": ["전주시의회"], "preferred": false}, {"id": "5c360ae502c274ba26c57530bc4ec93a", "title": "순창군의회, 지방의회법 연내 제정 촉구에 한목소리", "publisher": "아시아뉴스전북", "published_at": "2026-10-28T16:05:11+09:00", "source_url": "https://www.mjeonbuk.com/news/articleView.html?idxno=149641", "matched_keywords": ["순창군의회"], "preferred": false}], "briefing": null}}}